* sg13g2-dll :: pfd -- generated by design/netlist.sh from design/pfd.sch
* do not edit by hand; regenerate with design/netlist.sh
** sch_path: design/pfd.sch
.subckt pfd REF FB UP DN VDD VSS
*.ipin REF
*.ipin FB
*.opin UP
*.opin DN
*.iopin VDD
*.iopin VSS
XED_UP REF set_up VDD VSS edgedet
XED_DN FB set_dn VDD VSS edgedet
XLU set_up reset UP upb_n VDD VSS srlatch
XLD set_dn reset DN dnb_n VDD VSS srlatch
XNR UP DN reset_n0 VDD VSS nand2_lv
XR1 reset_n0 reset_p1 VDD VSS inv_lv
XR2 reset_p1 reset_n2 VDD VSS inv_lv
XR3 reset_n2 reset VDD VSS inv2x_lv
.ends

* expanding   symbol:  edgedet.sym # of pins=4
** sym_path: design/edgedet.sym
** sch_path: design/edgedet.sch
.subckt edgedet X OUT VDD VSS
*.ipin X
*.opin OUT
*.iopin VDD
*.iopin VSS
XD1 X d1 VDD VSS inv_lv
XD2 d1 d2 VDD VSS inv_lv
XD3 d2 d3 VDD VSS inv_lv
XD4 d3 d4 VDD VSS inv_lv
XD5 d4 d5 VDD VSS inv_lv
XN1 X d5 ntmp VDD VSS nand2_lv
XOUT ntmp OUT VDD VSS inv_lv
.ends


* expanding   symbol:  srlatch.sym # of pins=6
** sym_path: design/srlatch.sym
** sch_path: design/srlatch.sch
.subckt srlatch S R Q QB VDD VSS
*.ipin S
*.ipin R
*.opin Q
*.opin QB
*.iopin VDD
*.iopin VSS
XIS S SB VDD VSS inv_lv
XIR R RB VDD VSS inv_lv
XNQ SB QB Q VDD VSS nand2_lv
XNQB RB Q QB VDD VSS nand2_lv
.ends


* expanding   symbol:  nand2_lv.sym # of pins=5
